---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/url';

const shots = [
  { src: url('/city-hero/renders/01_wide_port.jpg'), label: '01 · Port wide / three native towers' },
  { src: url('/city-hero/renders/02_pad_closeup.jpg'), label: '02 · 60 m TLOF / A-30' },
  { src: url('/city-hero/renders/03_aerial_skyline.jpg'), label: '03 · Skyline aerial' },
  { src: url('/city-hero/renders/04_terminal_detail.jpg'), label: '04 · T2 arrival hall' },
  { src: url('/city-hero/renders/05_hero_facade.jpg'), label: '05 · K038 LargeJ facade' },
  { src: url('/city-hero/renders/06_city_platform.jpg'), label: '06 · 1200 m city platform' },
  { src: url('/city-hero/renders/07_terminal_approach.jpg'), label: '07 · T2 terminal approach' },
];
---

<Base title="Nautilus Reach · 城市样本 v2" description="Nautilus Reach v2 — 1200 m 城市平台、三栋原生单塔、CommunityCentre 到港厅、K015 远景剪影">
  <main class="city-hero">
    <header class="hero-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Kitbash3D K032 / K038 / K046 / K015 · private authored sample</p>
      <h1>Nautilus Reach</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        1200 × 1200 m 平坦城市平台，40 m 挡土墙，60 m TLOF，25 m A-30。
        三栋原生单塔 <strong>220.3 / 222.7 / 240.7 m</strong>，一栋一个 mesh、scale 1.0；
        K038 不再上下叠成 563 m 巨构。650M1 <strong>CommunityCentre</strong> 103 m
        作为 T2 到港厅；K015 只作为 1.3 km 外的暗色远景剪影。
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="primary" href={url('/city-hero/renders/01_wide_port.jpg')}>打开全尺寸 01 →</a>
        <a href={url('/city-hero/manifest.json')}>manifest.json</a>
      </div>
      <dl class="stats">
        <div><dt>英雄塔</dt><dd>K032 A 220.3 m / K038 J 222.7 m / K038 I 240.7 m</dd></div>
        <div><dt>原生三角面</dt><dd>275,250 / 357,771 / 206,982 native</dd></div>
        <div><dt>场景总量</dt><dd>15.35 M tris · 1,200 m deck</dd></div>
        <div><dt>渲染</dt><dd>Cycles 1920×1080 · 160 samples · AgX/OIDN</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </header>

    <section class="shot-grid" aria-label="Renders">
      {shots.map((shot) => (
        <a class="shot" href={shot.src}>
          <img src={shot.src} alt={shot.label} loading="lazy" />
          <span>{shot.label}</span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </section>

    <section class="notes">
      <p>
        <strong>不叠楼：</strong>K032 BldgLG_A、K038 LargeJ、K038 LargeI 各只出现一次，
        原生 220–241 m，无 uniform giant scaling、无垂直堆叠。K039 只做 1:1 的
        10–28 m 低层/中景；K015 以 100× 单位修正放在城市平台外 1.3 km，
        仅作远景剪影和背景城市 massing。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>1:1 港口：</strong>CommunityCentre 到港厅、60 m TLOF、25 m A-30、
        龙门架、储罐、管线、集装箱、C2184 面板墙、K014/K034 greeble、Modelshop
        角色。近景细节来自 authored 几何，不靠程序化拉伸。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>限制：</strong>这是离线 Cycles 质量样本，未重建实时 GLB/preview；
        Kitbash3D / Modelshop 资产只用于私有/离线渲染，公开 Web 前需单独评估授权。
        K015 的 1K 贴图不作为近景细节，只提供远景轮廓。
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .city-hero {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 84px 24px 72px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent, #67d6ff);
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 92px);
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .lede {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    color: var(--dim, #9fb0bf);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .lede strong { color: #e9eef2; font-weight: 600; }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 26px 0 34px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .actions a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .primary {
    border: 1px solid rgba(103, 214, 255, 0.5);
    padding: 10px 15px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0 0 34px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }
  .stats div { min-width: 0; }
  .stats dt {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--dim, #9fb0bf);
  }
  .stats dd {
    margin: 5px 0 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .shot-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 0 0 34px;
  }
  .shot {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #0a1016;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }
  .shot:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .shot img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    transition: transform 0.6s ease;
  }
  .shot:hover img { transform: scale(1.015); }
  .shot span {
    position: absolute;
    left: 10px;
    bottom: 9px;
    padding: 4px 7px;
    background: rgba(4, 9, 14, 0.68);
    color: #e9eef2;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .notes {
    max-width: 860px;
    color: var(--dim, #9fb0bf);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .notes p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .notes strong { color: #e9eef2; font-weight: 600; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .shot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .shot:first-child { grid-column: auto; }
  }
</style>
